    "            \"kualitas data (kelengkapan, keunikan, spasial-habitat, resolusi taksonomi Catalogue of Life XR, \"\n",
    "            \"dan metadata-temporal) serta pemisahan Clean Set dan Quarantine Store.\"\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        \"created_date\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n",
